# The secret that Deploy on Cloudflare asks for. Choose any value of at least 16 characters and
# keep it until you have typed it once at /setup, where it proves you own this deployment.
# Setup closes for good after the owner exists.
SETUP_SECRET=

# Optional, so Deploy on Cloudflare does not ask for them. Add them in the Cloudflare dashboard
# only when you need them:
# APP_ORIGIN: the app address, with https:// and no path. Without it, the app uses the address
#   where you did the setup. Set it to move the app; see docs/self-hosting/origin.md.
# AUTH_SECRET: signs sessions, 32 to 256 characters. Without it, the Worker makes its own and
#   keeps it in the identity database.
